## Second-pass review questions

1. What is the single most important receipt in this book?  
2. What would a false (above-ceiling) claim look like on this topic?  
3. Which curriculum module does this book feed?  
4. What will you teach an initiate first from these pages?  
5. What must never be done with H7c for this title?  

Answer in writing or speech. Re-read weak chapters. **End of book.**
